del vidrio delantero, la geometr\u00eda estructural y la base plana del Apple Watch son el secreto de su gran resistencia. Adem\u00e1s, puedes sumergirte con \u00e9l hasta 50 metros de profundidad.<\/p><h2>Pide ayuda. Es tan f\u00e1cil como llevar tu reloj.<\/h2><p>El Series 9 puede llamar al 112 si has tenido un accidente de coche, has sufrido una ca\u00edda grave o necesitas asistencia urgente.<\/p><h2>Detecci\u00f3n de accidentes<\/h2><p>El Apple Watch Series 9 puede detectar si has sufrido un accidente de coche grave, y autom\u00e1ticamente llama a los servicios de emergencia, les env\u00eda tu ubicaci\u00f3n y avisa a los contactos que hayas definido.<\/p><h2>Detecci\u00f3n de ca\u00eddas<\/h2><p>El Apple Watch Series 9 detecta si has sufrido una ca\u00edda brusca y llama de manera autom\u00e1tica a los servicios de emergencia si no eres capaz de moverte. Esta prestaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 optimizada para la app<\/p><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"APPLE","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":685.86,"unit_price_tax":685.86,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Apple","sub_category":"Apple Watch","quantity":0,"brand":"APPLE","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_apl-watch%20mrj43qlbardera_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":680.86}}},"0195949025389":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["0195949025389",false],"wholesale_price":[680.86,false],"price":[685.86,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["2 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":